UID:10011706-1782655200-1782660600@njaudubon.org
SUMMARY:Nature Art Club: Cyanotype Printing
DESCRIPTION:Join us at Lorrimer Sanctuary on the fourth Sunday of every month for nature-based art projects! \nCyanotype Printing: \nConnect with the environment in a fun and unique way with cyanotype printing! Make your own nature-based compositions and let the sun do the printing for you! The program will begin with a short walk on the trails at Lorrimer Sanctuary followed by a printing demonstration. \nIMPORTANT INFORMATION: \n\nSupplies will be provided\nThis is an all ages event\, not a drop off program: children must have an accompanying adult if under 16 years old\nThis event will be both indoors and outdoors\, please dress appropriately for the weather.\n\nTicket sale for each class ends at 4:00 PM on the day before the class. \nCOST: $18 members\, $20 non-members \nPlease note that Lorrimer’s building facilities will be going under construction this winter. If this leads to cancelled programming\, we will refund your order completely and let you know as soon as possible about these cancellations. \nCANCELLATION: NJ Audubon’s programs require a minimum number of registrants to run. If we cancel\, due to lack of participation\, severe weather\, or unforeseen circumstances\, all participants will be notified as soon as possible and are eligible for a full refund. Participants may cancel without penalty if greater than 48 hours in advance. Sorry\, no refund for cancellations less than 48 hours in advance unless due to health emergencies; however\, registrations can be transferred to another program in the future. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://njaudubon.org/event/nature-art-club-cyanotype-printing/
LOCATION:Lorrimer Sanctuary\, 790 Ewing Avenue\, Franklin Lakes\, NJ\, 07417\, United States
CATEGORIES:Event,Family Program,Lorrimer Sanctuary
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://njaudubon.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Nature-Art-Club-Create-Your-Own-Nature-Journal.jpeg
